# Orchestra AI — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete **local-first multi-agent AI software development system** with 50+ source files across 12 subsystems.

### Backend (Python + FastAPI)
| Component | Files | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| **Data Models** | `models/*.py` | 5 SQLAlchemy ORM models: Task, Agent, Artifact, RunLog, PullRequest |
| **Schemas** | `schemas/*.py` | Pydantic request/response schemas for all models |
| **API Routes** | `api/*.py` | 6 route modules: tasks, agents, orchestrator, artifacts, PRs, dashboard |
| **Agent Framework** | `agents/*.py` | Base agent + 7 specialized agents + registry with reviewer mapping |
| **Orchestrator** | [orchestrator/core.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/orchestrator/core.py) | Central brain: request→plan→execute→review→approve→git→PR lifecycle |
| **LLM Gateway** | [llm/gateway.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/llm/gateway.py) | LM Studio integration (CodeLlama-7B at 127.0.0.1:1234) with fallback chain |
| **Memory** | `memory/*.py` | Short-term (dict) + Long-term (FAISS vector store) |
| **Tools** | [tools/executor.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/tools/executor.py) | Docker-sandboxed file/git/terminal execution with per-agent access control |
| **Git Manager** | [git_manager/operations.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/git_manager/operations.py) | GitPython with branch-per-task, auto-commit, PR creation |
| **ACE Engine** | [ace/engine.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/ace/engine.py) | Context learning from approved tasks — playbooks, decisions, versioned rollback |

### Frontend (React + TypeScript + Vite)
| Component | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| **TaskBoard** | Kanban with 4 columns (Backlog/In Progress/Review/Done), task detail modal |
| **AgentPanel** | All 7 agents with status, task counts, pause/resume controls |
| **AgentFeed** | Real-time activity log from RunLog table |
| **ArtifactViewer** | Browse and view code/docs/designs produced by agents |
| **App** | Request input bar, stats dashboard, toast notifications |

### Infrastructure
- **Docker sandbox** ([docker/sandbox.Dockerfile](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/docker/sandbox.Dockerfile)) for safe command execution
- **Setup script** ([setup.sh](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/setup.sh)) — one-command installation
- **Environment config** ([.env](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/.env)) pointing to LM Studio

## Verification Results

| Test | Result |
|------|--------|
| `GET /health` | ✅ `{"status":"healthy"}` |
| `GET /api/agents/` | ✅ 7 agents returned (PM, UX, Frontend, Backend, FullStack, Research, DB) |
| `GET /api/tasks/board` | ✅ Empty Kanban (`{backlog:[], in_progress:[], review:[], done:[]}`) |
| Database init | ✅ All 5 tables created (agents, tasks, artifacts, run_logs, pull_requests) |
| Agent seeding | ✅ 7 agents auto-seeded on startup |
| Frontend npm install | ✅ Dependencies installed |

## How to Run

```bash
# Terminal 1 — Backend
cd "/Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra AI Made"
PYTHONPATH=. python3 -m uvicorn backend.main:app --reload --port 8000

# Terminal 2 — Frontend
cd "/Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra AI Made/frontend"
npm run dev
```

- **Dashboard**: http://localhost:3000
- **API Docs**: http://localhost:8000/docs
- **LM Studio**: Must be running at http://127.0.0.1:1234
